==Reaction Modifiers==
''See also: [[Game Mechanics#Faction System and Levels]] for a breakdown of the different Reaction Modifiers''

In addition to the Standing Value, some modifiers are applied to determine the final value that would result in a given NPC belonging to that Primary Faction. A number of mods apply. The standard reaction mods are: Race, Class and Deity. Other mods may apply.

